## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [.NET SDK {{ dotnet_version }}](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download)
- [Azure Functions Core Tools v4](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/functions-run-local)

### Local Development

```bash
cd src/{{ pascal_case_name }}.Functions
dotnet restore
func start
```

The function will be available at `http://localhost:7071`.

### Running Tests

```bash
cd tests/{{ pascal_case_name }}.Functions.Tests
dotnet test
```

